Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: schematron.c
Line: 1625
Function: xmlSchematronReportSuccess
Bug type: use-after-free
CWE: CWE-416
Explanation: After invoking xmlRaiseError or xmlSchematronReportOutput (lines 1591-1621), user-provided callbacks can free or otherwise invalidate the node 'cur'. The subsequent comparison uses 'cur->name' at line 1625 to decide whether to free 'path', dereferencing a potentially freed node and causing a use-after-free read.

